WEBVTT

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
Fool Night

01:52.536 --> 01:56.206
Reception Room

05:30.045 --> 05:33.631
Hikasa + Kudai

05:58.531 --> 06:00.533
Kudai Hikasa

06:54.587 --> 06:59.759
Naam: Ai Akiyama
Sanstha: Meetup

09:09.806 --> 09:14.978
Tumhare shareer mein ek beej boya gaya tha

09:17.689 --> 09:20.525
Humne chori-chhupe ek
growth inhibitor banaya hai

09:20.608 --> 09:23.486
Jisse beej der se ugte hain

09:25.572 --> 09:28.032
Mere sawaal ka jawaab sach-sach dena

09:28.116 --> 09:31.160
Agar haan, to apna sir upar-neeche karna
Agar na, to apna sir daayen-baayen ghumana

09:31.327 --> 09:35.498
Hum woh growth inhibitor chala denge
Agar tumne jawaab diya

09:40.336 --> 09:41.254
Growth inhibitor

10:02.108 --> 10:04.902
Kya tum pehle kabhi Dr. Kudai se mile ho?

10:31.137 --> 10:33.473
Kya tum use yahan mile?

10:37.560 --> 10:39.228
Is ilaake mein?

10:40.813 --> 10:42.231
Yahan?!

10:44.317 --> 10:51.324
Kahan? Kisi aur bade shahar mein?

10:53.201 --> 10:58.998
Ken Hikasa ke paas das ya
usse zyada intelligence agents hain

11:14.472 --> 11:17.141
Hum abhi growth inhibitor nahi de sakte

11:17.225 --> 11:21.396
Teen dinon mein doctor ke baare
mein zaroori jaankari lekar aao…

15:16.130 --> 15:19.216
Khatra!

15:28.768 --> 15:30.770
Marukyuten

16:04.011 --> 16:06.013
Wanagaki

17:51.285 --> 17:53.037
House of Love
Sasaki Anaathalay

17:53.120 --> 17:57.208
Thank you Hisaka Uncle!

20:14.887 --> 20:15.721
Nahin sahenge!

20:15.804 --> 20:16.847
Kahan gaye tumhare usool?

20:27.149 --> 20:29.568
Kaori aur Toshirou Kamiya

20:54.426 --> 21:00.099
Shika
